      "statement": "StoredAlignment records which of each reviewer's repeated entries are the same entry as an explicit mapping rather than by reordering reviewers' arrays (the pre-v1.7 approach that wrote Consolidation bookkeeping into other people's data). alignedReviews projects reviewers' trees through the mapping as a throwaway lined-up view without touching stored trees. It is persisted because slot N must keep meaning the same thing once a consolidator commits an answer under it.",
