      "statement": "normalizeTree reconciles a value tree against the schema: drops keys not in the schema, coerces instance structure, pads up to min (at least 1), clamps to max. It adopts shorthand shapes (bare primitive, single entry where a list is wanted) as the value rather than dropping them, because this walk rewrites the file and discarding would let the next save overwrite a real answer with null.",
