      "statement": "deepEqualJson is structural JSON equality: order-independent for object keys, order-sensitive for arrays, exactly JSON's notion otherwise. It is deliberately not a text comparison; needsShapeMigration uses it so whitespace/key-order rewrites never look like a reason to migrate a fine file, and git/merge.ts shares it for three-way field-change decisions.",
